*> GGPlot, the ggplot2-style grammar-of-graphics library: seven iris plots.
*> CMD: just TARGET=ggplot_ex run-cobol
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. GGPLOT-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

01 IRIS      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 GG        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 GRAY      USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_data_iris" USING DM-DATA-IRIS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-DATA-IRIS-RESULT TO IRIS
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-DATA

    *> ggplot(iris, aes(x = Sepal.Length, y = Sepal.Width, color = Species)) + geom_point()
    MOVE 4 TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "Sepal.Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-X-COLUMN
    MOVE "Sepal.Width" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-Y-COLUMN
    MOVE "Species" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-COLOR-COLUMN
    PERFORM NEW-GG-PLOT
    MOVE 0 TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-POINT-GIVEN
    PERFORM GEOM-POINT
    MOVE "Iris Sepal Dimensions" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-TITLE
    MOVE "Sepal Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-X
    MOVE "Sepal Width" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-Y
    PERFORM LABS
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-THEME-MINIMAL-SELF
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_theme_minimal" USING DM-GG-PLOT-THEME-MINIMAL DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-THEME-MINIMAL-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "cobol_ggplot_point.svg" TO DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-GG-PLOT

    *> + geom_smooth(): an lm() fit line, reusing stats::LM internally.
    MOVE 3 TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "Sepal.Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-X-COLUMN
    MOVE "Petal.Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-Y-COLUMN
    PERFORM NEW-GG-PLOT
    *> A gray RGB, built like the Lua rgb() helper: default RGB, then set r, g, b.
    CALL "dm_rgb_new" USING DM-RGB-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-RGB-NEW-RESULT TO GRAY
    MOVE GRAY TO DM-RGB-R-SELF DM-RGB-G-SELF DM-RGB-B-SELF
    MOVE 156 TO DM-RGB-R-VALUE
    MOVE 163 TO DM-RGB-G-VALUE
    MOVE 175 TO DM-RGB-B-VALUE
    CALL "dm_rgb_r_set" USING DM-RGB-R DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    CALL "dm_rgb_g_set" USING DM-RGB-G DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    CALL "dm_rgb_b_set" USING DM-RGB-B DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE 2 TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-POINT-GIVEN
    MOVE GRAY TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-POINT-COLOR
    MOVE 2.5 TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-POINT-SIZE
    PERFORM GEOM-POINT
    MOVE GRAY TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-SMOOTH-SELF
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_geom_smooth" USING DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-SMOOTH DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-SMOOTH-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "Petal Length vs Sepal Length With a Linear Fit" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-TITLE
    MOVE "Sepal Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-X
    MOVE "Petal Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-Y
    PERFORM LABS
    MOVE "cobol_ggplot_smooth.svg" TO DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-GG-PLOT

    *> geom_bar(): counts a discrete column (stat = "count").
    MOVE 2 TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "Species" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-X-COLUMN
    PERFORM NEW-GG-PLOT
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-BAR-SELF
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_geom_bar" USING DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-BAR DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-BAR-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "Observations per Species" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-TITLE
    MOVE "Species" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-X
    MOVE "Count" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-Y
    PERFORM LABS
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-THEME-BW-SELF
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_theme_bw" USING DM-GG-PLOT-THEME-BW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-THEME-BW-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "cobol_ggplot_bar.svg" TO DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-GG-PLOT

    *> geom_boxplot(): grouped by a discrete x column.
    MOVE 3 TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "Species" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-X-COLUMN
    MOVE "Petal.Width" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-Y-COLUMN
    PERFORM NEW-GG-PLOT
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-BOXPLOT-SELF
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_geom_boxplot" USING DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-BOXPLOT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-BOXPLOT-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "Petal Width by Species" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-TITLE
    MOVE "Species" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-X
    MOVE "Petal Width" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-Y
    PERFORM LABS
    MOVE "cobol_ggplot_boxplot.svg" TO DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-GG-PLOT

    *> geom_histogram() + geom_density(): distribution of a single numeric column.
    MOVE 2 TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "Sepal.Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-X-COLUMN
    PERFORM NEW-GG-PLOT
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-HISTOGRAM-SELF
    MOVE 1 TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-HISTOGRAM-GIVEN
    MOVE 20 TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-HISTOGRAM-BINS
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_geom_histogram" USING DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-HISTOGRAM DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-HISTOGRAM-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "Distribution of Sepal Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-TITLE
    MOVE "Sepal Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-X
    MOVE "Count" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-Y
    PERFORM LABS
    MOVE "cobol_ggplot_histogram.svg" TO DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-GG-PLOT

    PERFORM NEW-GG-PLOT
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-DENSITY-SELF
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_geom_density" USING DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-DENSITY DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-DENSITY-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "Density of Sepal Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-TITLE
    MOVE "Sepal Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-X
    MOVE "Density" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-Y
    PERFORM LABS
    MOVE "cobol_ggplot_density.svg" TO DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-GG-PLOT

    *> facet_wrap(): one panel per Species, composed via RLayout under the hood.
    MOVE 3 TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "Petal.Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-X-COLUMN
    MOVE "Petal.Width" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-Y-COLUMN
    PERFORM NEW-GG-PLOT
    MOVE 0 TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-POINT-GIVEN
    PERFORM GEOM-POINT
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-FACET-WRAP-SELF
    MOVE "Species" TO DM-GG-PLOT-FACET-WRAP-COLUMN
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_facet_wrap" USING DM-GG-PLOT-FACET-WRAP DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-FACET-WRAP-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "Petal Dimensions" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-TITLE
    MOVE "Petal Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-X
    MOVE "Petal Width" TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-Y
    PERFORM LABS
    MOVE "cobol_ggplot_facet.svg" TO DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-GG-PLOT

    *> theme_classic(): another built-in theme.
    MOVE 4 TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-GIVEN
    MOVE "Sepal.Length" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-X-COLUMN
    MOVE "Sepal.Width" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-Y-COLUMN
    MOVE "Species" TO DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-COLOR-COLUMN
    PERFORM NEW-GG-PLOT
    PERFORM GEOM-POINT
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-THEME-CLASSIC-SELF
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_theme_classic" USING DM-GG-PLOT-THEME-CLASSIC DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-THEME-CLASSIC-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    MOVE "cobol_ggplot_classic.svg" TO DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH
    PERFORM SAVE-GG-PLOT

    DISPLAY "Wrote 7 SVGs to cobol_ggplot_*.svg"
    MOVE IRIS TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE
    STOP RUN.

*> Starts GG from the DM-GG-PLOT-NEW fields already set.
NEW-GG-PLOT.
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_new" USING DM-GG-PLOT-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-NEW-RESULT TO GG.

*> Adds a point layer; -GIVEN, -COLOR and -SIZE are already set.
GEOM-POINT.
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-POINT-SELF
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_geom_point" USING DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-POINT DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    *> Chainable methods return a GGPlot & handle; close it.
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-GEOM-POINT-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE.

*> Sets the title and axis labels from the DM-GG-PLOT-LABS fields.
LABS.
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-SELF
    MOVE 3 TO DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-GIVEN
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_labs" USING DM-GG-PLOT-LABS DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-GG-PLOT-LABS-RESULT TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE.

*> Saves GG to DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-PATH and closes it.
SAVE-GG-PLOT.
    MOVE GG TO DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG-SELF
    CALL "dm_gg_plot_save_svg" USING DM-GG-PLOT-SAVE-SVG DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE GG TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    PERFORM CLOSE-HANDLE.

CLOSE-HANDLE.
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
